Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, इस updated Batch one में हर rule\Nऔर clause का exact reference पहले बोलो,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.52,0:00:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,फिर simple city Hinglish\Nexplanation और उसके बाद example दो.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.46,0:00:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Roman one, two, three, four का मतलब\Nbracket वाले Roman numerals है.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.76,0:00:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule two, sub rule one की conditions\Nको made up clause letters मत देना.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.30,0:00:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule one, sub rule one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.32,0:00:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Official name है Central Civil\NServices, Leave Travel Concession Rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.84,0:00:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,nineteen eighty eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.12,0:00:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Asha की family LTC application\Nके लिए LTC rules check होंगे,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,pension rules नहीं.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.40,0:00:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule one, sub rule two.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.94,0:00:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Rules Gazette में publication की date\Nसे start होते हैं, signing date से नहीं.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.12,0:00:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Notification May third को\Nsign और May twenty first को publish हो,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.91,0:00:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,तो publication वाली date count होगी.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.84,0:00:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ये dates सिर्फ example हैं.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Actual nineteen eighty eight Gazette\Nकी exact date original copy से confirm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.46,0:00:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,नहीं हुई है.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.28,0:00:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule one, sub rule three, opening words.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.07,0:00:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Coverage, Rule one, sub rule\Nfour के exclusions के subject है.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.44,0:01:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Covered होना automatic approval नहीं है.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.08,0:01:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Union civil post\Nवाला employee part time है,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.15,0:01:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,तो exclusion भी check करना होगा.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule one, sub rule three, clause Roman one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.38,0:01:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Union civil services और posts covered हैं.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.99,0:01:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Defence Services के civilian\NGovernment employees भी included हैं.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.92,0:01:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Meera Defence\Noffice में civilian clerk है.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.80,0:01:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,सिर्फ Defence में काम करने की\Nवजह से उसे exclude नहीं करेंगे.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.14,0:01:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule one, sub rule three, clause Roman two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.34,0:01:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,State Government employee Central Government\Nमें deputation पर आए, तो coverage है.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.88,0:01:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Raghav State cadre से Central\NMinistry में deputation पर आया.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.80,0:01:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Coverage के बाद Rule two की\Nconditions भी check होंगी.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.74,0:01:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule one, sub rule three, clause Roman three.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.90,0:01:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Contract basis पर Government\Nappointments included हैं.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.36,0:01:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Neha को direct\NGovernment contract मिला.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.24,0:01:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,सिर्फ contract job होने से\Nउसे exclude नहीं करेंगे.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.45,0:01:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Vendor employee को Ministry में काम करने\Nसे automatically यही status नहीं मिलता.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.25,0:01:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule one, sub rule three, clause Roman four.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.00,0:02:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Retirement के बाद re employed\Npersons included हैं.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.70,0:02:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Dev को actual Government\Nre employment appointment मिला.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.20,0:02:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,उसका case check होगा.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.56,0:02:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,सिर्फ pension मिलने से हर\Nretiree को LTC नहीं मिलती.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.90,0:02:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule one, sub rule four, clause A.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.62,0:02:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Non whole time Government\Nemployment excluded है.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.66,0:02:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Three hours daily की part\Ntime appointment कई years चलने से whole
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.60,0:02:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,time नहीं बनती.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.80,0:02:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule one, sub rule four, clause B.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.90,0:02:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Casual और daily rated employment excluded है.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.30,0:02:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Salim daily rated worker है.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.68,0:02:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Twelve months complete होने से\Nये exclusion अपने आप नहीं हटता.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.30,0:02:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule one, sub rule four, clause C.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.58,0:02:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Persons paid from contingencies excluded हैं.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.94,0:02:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Kavita का actual engagement इसी\Ncategory में है, तो clause apply होगा.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,सिर्फ office में contingency budget होने\Nसे हर employee इस category में नहीं आता.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule one, sub rule four, clause D.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.46,0:02:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Railway servants generally excluded हैं.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.50,0:03:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,अलग later instructions में conditional\NAll India LTC once in a four year block की
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.37,0:03:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,limited window है.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.42,0:03:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Railway employee को इस\Nwindow से normal Hometown LTC
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.46,0:03:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,automatically नहीं मिलेगी.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.73,0:03:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass surrender की complete conditions की\Nprimary order verification pending है.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.77,0:03:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule one, sub rule four, clause E.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.68,0:03:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Armed Forces members excluded हैं.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.76,0:03:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Army officer और Defence office\Nकी civilian clerk को same category
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.06,0:03:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,में मत रखो.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.85,0:03:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Civilian inclusion अलग है.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.10,0:03:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule one, sub rule four, clause F.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.03,0:03:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Indian Missions abroad के\Nlocal recruits excluded हैं.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.16,0:03:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Paris Mission में locally hired\Nemployee और India से posted officer का
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.44,0:03:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,recruitment status अलग है.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.51,0:03:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule one, sub rule four, clause G.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.85,0:03:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,किसी दूसरे applicable travel concession की\Neligibility वाला exclusion check करना है.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.73,0:03:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wording eligibility है, सिर्फ actual use नहीं.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.50,0:03:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Employee बोले,\Nदूसरा benefit use नहीं किया.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,सिर्फ ये बोलना enough नहीं है.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.44,0:03:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,हर private sector spouse की\NLTA को blanket ban मत समझो.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.78,0:03:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Relevant later instructions भी check करो.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.20,0:04:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule two, sub rule one, covered categories.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.03,0:04:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,ये Rule one, sub rule\Nthree के clauses Roman two,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.64,0:04:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Roman three और Roman four के लिए है.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.48,0:04:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, State deputationist, contract\Nofficer और re employed officer के cases में
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.54,0:04:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,ये test देखो.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.42,0:04:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Re employment में sub rule\Nthree की continuity भी साथ पढ़ो.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule two, sub rule one,\Ncompleted service condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.14,0:04:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,One year की continuous Central\NGovernment service complete होनी चाहिए.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.76,0:04:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Neha four year contract sign\Nकरके six months बाद trip plan करती है.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.52,0:04:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Long contract, six months\Nको one year नहीं बना देता.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.43,0:04:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule two, sub rule one,\Ncertification condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.78,0:04:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Appropriate administrative authority\Nको required likely service period
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.72,0:04:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,certify करना है.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.80,0:04:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Employee खुद four\Nyears रहने का promise करे,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.97,0:04:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,तो वो authority के certificate\Nका substitute नहीं है.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.16,0:04:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule two, sub rule one,\NHometown duration condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.10,0:04:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,At least two years की likely Central\Nservice joining date से count होगी,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.22,0:04:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,trip के बाद two extra years नहीं.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.70,0:05:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Contract January first, twenty\Ntwenty six से December thirty first,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.40,0:05:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,twenty twenty seven तक है.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.72,0:05:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,February twenty twenty seven में one\Nyear complete है और joining से total
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.04,0:05:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,two years हैं.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.28,0:05:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Proper certificate के साथ ये\Nduration condition pass हो सकती है.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.62,0:05:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,बाकी LTC conditions भी check होंगी.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.60,0:05:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule two, sub rule one, Any Place\Nin India duration condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.56,0:05:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,At least four years की likely Central\Nservice joining date से count होगी.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Contract January first, twenty\Ntwenty six से December thirty first,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.30,0:05:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,twenty twenty nine तक है.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.10,0:05:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,February twenty twenty seven में one\Nyear complete है और joining से total
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.94,0:05:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,four years हैं.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.12,0:05:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Four years trip से फिर count नहीं होंगे.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.62,0:05:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,ये duration condition है,\Nfinal LTC approval नहीं.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.46,0:05:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule two, sub rule two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Initial one year contract बाद में extend हो,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.45,0:05:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,तो total contract duration LTC के लिए देखो.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Neha का twenty twenty six वाला\Ncontract बिना gap twenty twenty nine
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.22,0:05:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,तक extend हुआ.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.06,0:05:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,सिर्फ first one year\Nletter देखकर reject मत करो.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.10,0:05:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Actual extension order चाहिए.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.86,0:06:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule two, sub rule three, immediate\Nre employment and continuity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.72,0:06:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Retirement के immediately बाद बिना break\Nre employment में old और new service LTC के
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.58,0:06:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,लिए continuous treat होती है.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.43,0:06:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Retirement October thirty first\Nके end पर और re employment November
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.72,0:06:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,first से है.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.66,0:06:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fresh one year clock\Nautomatically start मत करो.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.00,0:06:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Gap वाले case में ये special treatment\Nautomatically assume नहीं कर सकते.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.80,0:06:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule two, sub rule three, provided that\Ncondition, also called the proviso.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.60,0:06:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Simple test, retire न होते तो ये LTC मिलती?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.38,0:06:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Continuity, used benefit refill नहीं करती.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.68,0:06:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Sana की relevant All India\Noccasion retirement से पहले use हो चुकी है.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.04,0:06:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Next day re employment same\Noccasion दोबारा नहीं देती.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.38,0:06:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule two, sub rule three,\Nofficial illustration.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.76,0:06:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Already used Any Place in India LTC, same\Nfour year block में no break re employment
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.66,0:06:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,से फिर नहीं मिलती.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.12,0:06:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Official illustration\Nका updated hypothetical लो.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.74,0:07:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Dev ने twenty twenty six to twenty twenty\Nnine की All India occasion August में use
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.83,0:07:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,की, October में retire हुआ\Nऔर next day re employed हुआ.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.60,0:07:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Same block में fresh All\NIndia occasion नहीं मिलेगी.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.44,0:07:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule three, employee coverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.18,0:07:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Scope में employee और eligible family आते हैं.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.32,0:07:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule three में अलग numbered\Nsub rules नहीं हैं.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.88,0:07:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Eligible employee अकेले trip करता है.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.68,0:07:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Family साथ नहीं है, सिर्फ इस वजह\Nसे Rule three उसे reject नहीं करता.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.64,0:07:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule three, family coverage,\Nread with Rule four, clause D.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.82,0:07:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Family का legal meaning check करो.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.22,0:07:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule four, clause D की full\Ndetail next batch में होगी.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.83,0:07:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Spouse और friend साथ travel करते हैं.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.44,0:07:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Friend सिर्फ साथ जाने से eligible\NLTC family member नहीं बनता.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.90,0:07:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule three, cross reference to Rules\Nnine and eleven, and the July first,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.62,0:07:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,twenty twenty five FAQ, question six.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.30,0:07:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Employee और eligible family separate\Ngroups में अलग time पर travel कर सकते हैं.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.37,0:07:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,ये Rule three का नया sub clause नहीं है.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.66,0:07:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Employee June में और eligible\Nfamily October में travel propose करे,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.36,0:07:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,तो separate dates alone\Nrejection का reason नहीं हैं.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.13,0:08:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Person wise block और बाकी\Nconditions check होंगी.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.62,0:08:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,September third, twenty twenty five\NDoPT Guidelines, applicability Note one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.26,0:08:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Autonomous body officer Central\NGovernment में deputation पर आए,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.04,0:08:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,तो उस period में temporary Government\Nservant वाला LTC treatment मिलता है.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.07,0:08:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,ये Rule one का नया numbered clause नहीं है.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.42,0:08:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Iqbal को सिर्फ autonomous\Nparent body की वजह से reject नहीं करेंगे.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.92,0:08:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Temporary word से हर Rule two\Ncertificate automatically infer मत करो.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Actual category और deputation terms check करो.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.72,0:08:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,September third, twenty twenty five\NDoPT Guidelines, applicability Note two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.20,0:08:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Industrial और work charged staff\Nजो regular leave के entitled हैं,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.33,0:08:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,वो भी normal conditions पर eligible हैं.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.44,0:08:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Regular leave वाले work charged\Nemployee को सिर्फ job title से blanket
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.62,0:08:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,reject मत करो.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.47,0:08:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,First block nineteen sixty to sixty one\Nhistorical है, आज का travel block नहीं.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.30,0:08:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,September third, twenty twenty five\NDoPT Guidelines, paragraph two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.73,0:08:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Consolidation में conflict\Nया unclear summary हो,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.38,0:08:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,तो relevant governing OM या order check करो.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.29,0:09:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,ये Rule two का sub rule नहीं है.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.42,0:09:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Summary की unclear\Nline को नया amendment मत मानो.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.37,0:09:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Actual applicable order की reference लो.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.38,0:09:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Batch one teaching checklist,\Nnot a separate legal rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.39,0:09:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Category, exclusion, valid exception,\Nspecial service conditions,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.12,0:09:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,old block history और\Neligible family check करो.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.34,0:09:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Example, Contract officer ये\Nstarting checks pass करता है.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.96,0:09:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,फिर भी payment से पहले family,\Nleave, block, mode, fare,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.08,0:09:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,booking और claim conditions अलग check होंगी.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.10,0:09:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Original Gazette date, detailed Railway\Npass conditions और complete later order
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.38,0:09:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,checks अभी open हैं.
